#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"trial\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Request a free trial for third-party quantum functions {#request-a-free-trial-for-third-party-quantum-functions}"
msgstr "Solicita una prueba gratuita para funciones cuánticas de terceros {#request-a-free-trial-for-third-party-quantum-functions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To request a free trial, navigate to the [IBM Quantum Functions Catalog](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions), and explore the details panel. Click `Request a free trial` and fill out information required by the functions partner, including your IBM Cloud account ID:\n"
msgstr "Para solicitar una prueba gratuita, ve al [Catálogo de funciones de IBM Quantum](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions) y explora el panel de detalles. Haz clic en `Request a free trial` y completa la información requerida por el socio de funciones, incluido tu ID de cuenta de IBM Cloud:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Navigate to [Account settings](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/account) and log in if you haven't already\n"
msgstr "Ve a [Account settings](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/account) e inicia sesión si aún no lo has hecho\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verify eligibility.\n"
msgstr "Verifica la elegibilidad.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Switch your account in the menu bar on the header to one with the following format: `XXXXXXX - [Organization Name]`\n"
msgstr "Cambia tu cuenta en el menú de la cabecera a una con el siguiente formato: `XXXXXXX - [Organization Name]`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ensure the organization is the same as the one associated with your Premium account.\n"
msgstr "Asegúrate de que la organización sea la misma que la asociada a tu cuenta Premium.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you see \"[Your Name]'s Account\", you are using your _personal_ account, which is not eligible for premium access.\n"
msgstr "Si ves \"[Your Name]'s Account\", estás usando tu cuenta _personal_, que no es elegible para el acceso premium.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find your account ID under  **Account ID**. It is a 32-character unique identifier.\n"
msgstr "Encuentra tu ID de cuenta en **Account ID**. Es un identificador único de 32 caracteres.\n"

